You concentrate to create a psionic block field all around you for 5 turns.

While the effect holds all damage against you have a [15%, 28%, 35%, 41%, 45% (TL1-5)] chance to be fully ignored.

When damage is cancelled you instinctively make a retaliation mind strike against the source, dealing [140, 188, 226, 258, 286 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage. (The retaliation may only happen 2 times per turn.)
